Welcome to the code for our final product: a hybrid model that will predict whether the patient will be in a hyper or hypo state during the night.

To run this script: All files should be downloaded and kept in the same folder-subfolder structure as here, where you run the 'main.py' script and it will produce results.
Edit the filepaths to your personal filepaths as indicated in the main.py file, and run the script.
